Short:        68k tutorial source file collection
Author:       All contibutors to the ACC project
Uploader:     cameronscottarmstrong gmail com (Nightfox)
Type:         dev/asm
Version:      1.0
Architecture: generic
Distribution: Aminet

This is an archive of the complete collection of the decrunched m68k Amiga
programming tutorial source files available on 32 issues of the floppy disk 
magazine from the Amiga Coders Club (1991-1993). Each disk was decrunched
one by one and all relevent files were placed in its own directory. The
original ADF collection of the magazines can be found at
http://aminet.net/dev/asm/acc.lha
